      "External 16×4116 DRAM and 2×2114 sprite SRAM; integrated 640-byte pixel FIFO and 320-byte row cache. Die-area estimate 80 mm² (60–110), about 65,000–95,000 transistors including SRAM; not a released layout. Qualify timing, large-package pin count, analog-free digital logic and one respin."
    ],
